          "thread": "Market price impact of BTC overhang",
          "why": "With billions in BTC still held, readers repeatedly engaged with whether large transfers would crash the market — and were relieved when analysis showed price stability despite the moves."
        },
        {
          "source": "https://www.mtgox.com/d/04y7ivbnz5gw.pdf",
          "thread": "Perpetual repayment deadline extensions",
          "why": "Two separate deadline-extension stories drew clicks, reflecting creditor frustration at the cycle of delayed timelines stretching from 2024 through 2026."
