          "thread": "Institutional acquisition of bankruptcy claims",
          "why": "Vivek Ramaswamy's Strive pursuing 75,000 BTC worth of Mt. Gox claims framed the bankruptcy estate as a live supply-dynamics play, attracting readers tracking corporate Bitcoin treasury strategies."
